Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 22:44:31 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] cpu: Fall back to CPU-prefixed thermal zones

Keep the existing hwmon and thermal-zone preferences. If none match,
read all zones whose type starts with cpu, including cpuss zones, and
report the highest readable temperature on every sample. This covers
numbered ARM thermal zones without selecting GPU or memory sensors.

Factor the thermal-zone reader out so GPU backends can reuse it. Test
duplicate zone types, unreadable inputs and changes in the hottest core.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
